Addressing Vulnerabilities: Even today, certain vulnerabilities exist—such as scammers attempting to fake large payments or inventory transactions (similar to fraud that happens in offline business).
​Built-in Security System: To counter this, we have integrated smart security layers into KhataPilot capable of detecting and blocking scams in real time.
​Example Use Case: Flagging or verifying unusually large transactions occurring between two shop owners operating from completely different locations.
